## Dev node (long name for cross-host clustering with beam nodes)
## inet_dist_use_interface forces Erlang to bind to beam-facing NIC
-name hecate_dev@host00.lab
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface '{192,168,1,100}'

## Site A cookie (shared with beam00-03)
-setcookie ZMFTAHTHAYKXRVMPPQIZ

## No heartbeat in dev (don't auto-restart on crash)
## -heart

## Interactive code server — required for in-VM plugin loading
-mode interactive

## Use standard EPMD for dev node discovery (overrides release's -start_epmd false)
-start_epmd true
-epmd_port 4369

-smp auto
+A 64
+P 1048576
+Q 65536
+sbt db
+SDio 32
